<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <title>Your KYC Verification is Successful – Next Steps</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #f6f6f6;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .btn {
      background-color: #2772f0;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: capitalize;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999999;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="content">
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
              <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfakuzuh2/image/upload/v1689410681/logo_cvkrer.png" alt="Algoralign" width="160">
            </div>
            <h3>Dear <strong>{{syndicate_lead_name}}</strong>,</h3>
            <p>We're pleased to inform you that your KYC verification has been successfully completed.</p>
            <p>You can now proceed with setting up your syndicate and launching your first deal on Algoralign.</p>
            <h4>Next Steps:</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>✅ Log in to your Algoralign dashboard.</li>
              <li>✅ Set up your syndicate and deal settings.</li>
              <li>✅ Start inviting investors and startups.</li>
            </ul>
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
              <a href="{{dashboard_link}}" class="btn">Go to Dashboard</a>
            </div>
            <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@algoralign.com">support@algoralign.com</a>.</p>
            <p>Best regards,</p>
            <p><strong>The Algoralign Team</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
          <p>Address details | <a href="#">Unsubscribe</a></p>
          <p>Powered by <a href="#">Algoralign</a></p>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
